+=== ext:zfh[] Extension for Half-Precision Floating-Point
+
+This chapter describes the ext:zfh[] standard extension for _half-precision_
+floating-point, which adds [#norm:zfh_ieee_compliance]#computational
+instructions compliant with the IEEE 754-2008 arithmetic standard's binary16
+format and operations.# The ext:zfh[] extension depends on the
+<<single-float,F>> extension.
+
+The NaN-boxing scheme described in <<nanboxing>> is extended to allow a
+half-precision value to be NaN-boxed inside a single-precision value (which may
+be recursively NaN-boxed inside a double- or quad-precision value when the
+<<chap:d,D>> or <<quad-float,Q>> extension is present).
 
 [NOTE]
 ====
