+This section describes the ext:zfhmin[] standard extension, which provides
+minimal support for half-precision binary floating-point instructions. The
+ext:zfhmin[] extension is a subset of the <<chap:zfh,Zfh>> extension, consisting
+only of data transfer and conversion instructions. Like ext:zfh[], ext:zfhmin[]
+depends on the <<single-float,F>> extension. The expectation is that
+ext:zfhmin[] software primarily uses the half-precision format for storage,
+performing most computation in higher precision.
 
